WEBVTT

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:06.820
So he is here.

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:08.820
Yuu! Come out this instant!

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:11.250
Yuu, I know you're in here! Yuu!

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:12.990
Wait a minute, please!

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:14.920
You're the one meddling with my!

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:18.080
What's wrong?
What's all the commotion?

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:19.860
Oh, is that you, Miyuki?

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:23.290
It's been ages.
What brings you here this early?

00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:24.970
Mom...

00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:26.800
Asuka, return Yuu!

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:28.870
Yuu-kun?

00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:30.670
Is he here, Haruka?

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:32.240
Uh...

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:37.060
Oh-ho?

00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:41.350
Miyuki, since you're here,
you should come on in.

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:45.210
I don't have that kind of time!
Now bring Yuu here at once!

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:49.290
You haven't changed.
You've always been so impatient.

00:00:49.290 --> 00:00:50.650
Excuse me?!

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:52.660
Just come on in.

00:00:53.630 --> 00:00:55.660
Haruka, put out a pair
of slippers for our guest.

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:57.160
C-Coming up!

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:02.470
H... Here you are.

00:01:07.910 --> 00:01:09.460
If you insist...

00:01:10.010 --> 00:01:15.670
At the silver sky, the endless sky

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:22.000
I gazed together with you, without a word

00:01:22.280 --> 00:01:28.180
Touching your back, with trembling fingers

00:01:28.370 --> 00:01:33.610
I quietly ponder, as your profile looks up

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:39.650
I want to assure your smile, and the future ahead of you

00:01:39.650 --> 00:01:45.990
Just standing and crying, I want to erase myself away

00:01:45.990 --> 00:01:51.870
As I extend my hands, it is almost within my reach

00:01:51.870 --> 00:01:57.920
This is no fantasy, possibilities are perhaps right by my side

00:01:57.920 --> 00:02:03.760
Changing every sorrow into strength

00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:09.930
Let's throw all limitations into the end of time

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:13.120
Just keeping you as my aspirations

00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:18.270
Even in the driving wind

00:02:19.060 --> 00:02:25.210
I'll still be pushing on ahead

00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:30.870
Misekku kesta

00:02:31.930 --> 00:02:38.790
Fortune. Will you save it for me, dear?

00:02:47.340 --> 00:02:49.770
There's something I want to tell you.

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:52.230
Wh... What?

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:57.990
You must protect Haruka at all costs!

00:02:59.850 --> 00:03:03.200
Why am I being ordered around by you?!

00:03:04.690 --> 00:03:06.260
Because...

00:03:06.630 --> 00:03:07.660
You are me!

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:19.380
I wonder if they're okay.

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:25.010
Baron, be quiet!

00:03:26.950 --> 00:03:28.510
There's a good boy.

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:31.440
Will Mom be okay?

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:35.620
It really has been a long time.

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:37.960
You haven't come over to this house
for a visit in ages!

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:40.650
You used to come over all the time.

00:03:46.570 --> 00:03:47.620
What is that?!

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:50.670
Let's have a drink together.

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:52.540
What are you talking about
at a time like this?!

00:03:52.810 --> 00:03:55.130
A time like this is
exactly the right time.

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:58.010
Now, no need to hesitate.

00:03:58.010 --> 00:04:00.820
- Asuka!
- This stuff is really good.

00:04:00.820 --> 00:04:03.080
Okay, let's drink today!

00:04:03.080 --> 00:04:05.060
- What are you doing, Mom?
- I haven't drunk this early in the day in ages.

00:04:05.060 --> 00:04:09.770
Really! That's the thing
about you that never changes.

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:13.520
Oh! Do I really have that much
of a youthful appearance?

00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:15.530
For goodness sake.

00:04:16.300 --> 00:04:19.530
Let's start with a toast
to the reunion of old friends!

00:04:19.530 --> 00:04:20.570
Huh?

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:22.170
C'mon, Miyuki!

00:04:22.170 --> 00:04:23.240
Hey...

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:24.790
Cheers!

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:27.410
That's right! I have to tell Yuu.

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:28.940
Come, Baron.

00:04:31.650 --> 00:04:32.750
Pathetic!

00:04:34.050 --> 00:04:36.800
D... Do you get a kick
out of threatening kids?

00:04:37.190 --> 00:04:38.510
Why do you run?

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:44.420
Listen carefully and remember this.
Running away won't do any good!

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:47.060
If you run, you will lose.

00:04:47.060 --> 00:04:50.790
If you don't want to lose, then fight!
Have the courage to fight!

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:52.520
Yuu!

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:56.730
Huh? What's going on?

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:07.000
Just "git."

00:05:10.650 --> 00:05:14.190
Hey, Yuu, what should we do?
Your mom knows.

00:05:14.190 --> 00:05:15.420
Just forget it.

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:22.350
Even if I stayed hidden in here,
she'd find me eventually.

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:25.630
Yuu...

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:27.320
Don't bother with him, Haruka.

00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:33.470
This kid is still too green
to sense how people think.

00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:37.410
You don't have to talk that way.

00:05:37.410 --> 00:05:41.240
If you're his future, why can't
you tell him what to do!

00:05:41.620 --> 00:05:43.240
This guy is my future?

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:47.240
It's pointless unless he
overcomes obstacles on his own.

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:50.680
That's cold, Karasu.

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:53.420
My future?

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:55.260
Never mind.

00:05:55.260 --> 00:05:56.400
Yuu?

00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:59.500
I don't believe a word
this guy says anyway.

00:06:00.870 --> 00:06:03.040
You're such a spineless twit!

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:04.570
Wh-What's with you?!

00:06:04.570 --> 00:06:06.220
Hold on a minute, Karasu!

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:09.220
You coward! You're responsible for...

00:06:09.540 --> 00:06:12.640
What the hell?! Don't talk like you're
so big just because you're an adult!

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:16.180
Don't, Karasu! That goes for you, too!

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:18.850
That jerk isn't my future!

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:21.610
You don't understand a thing about me!

00:06:22.660 --> 00:06:23.610
Yuu...

00:06:24.830 --> 00:06:27.320
So, what happened between you two?

00:06:27.600 --> 00:06:30.420
It... It's not that important.

00:06:30.770 --> 00:06:34.170
If that's the case, you should
kick back and stay here for a while.

00:06:34.170 --> 00:06:36.000
I can't do that!

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:39.710
The boy has exams. This is
an important time for him.

00:06:40.010 --> 00:06:41.980
Sounds busy.

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:44.180
How can you talk like that?

00:06:44.180 --> 00:06:47.470
You're making fun of me for forcing
my child to take exams, aren't you?!

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:49.550
Not at all.

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:51.990
You've always been that way.

00:06:51.990 --> 00:06:54.180
You're always patronizing me.

00:06:55.120 --> 00:06:56.650
Miyuki...

00:06:57.760 --> 00:07:00.980
Then why did you settle on your university
without even talking to me first?

00:07:01.660 --> 00:07:02.860
University?

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:05.830
That's right! You went off
to that art school in Tokyo.

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:09.700
Hold on a minute! I told you
the moment I got accepted.

00:07:10.070 --> 00:07:11.870
You had to have known!

00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:13.370
Huh?

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:17.370
You knew I wanted to go
to a university in Tokyo!

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:19.480
Miyuki?

00:07:19.480 --> 00:07:22.480
I have morning practice,
so I'm going without you.

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:25.260
Emi?! Wait for me, Emi!

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:31.850
My big sister was supposed to go
to a university in Tokyo.

00:07:33.290 --> 00:07:35.590
So, I wanted to go in her place...

00:07:37.270 --> 00:07:39.850
But my mother wouldn't let me...

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:42.230
Miyuki.

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:45.360
Mom loved Emi more than me.

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:47.820
A lot more than a reject like me.

00:07:49.580 --> 00:07:51.270
Far greater than me...

00:07:57.650 --> 00:07:59.420
I wonder why?

00:07:59.420 --> 00:08:00.990
Why what?

00:08:00.990 --> 00:08:04.220
Supposedly,
I'm identical to my late aunt.

00:08:05.360 --> 00:08:07.860
That's why Mom insists
that I study real hard...

00:08:07.860 --> 00:08:09.960
and go to a good middle school.

00:08:10.430 --> 00:08:13.890
In fact, I HAVE to.

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:17.740
Asuka, I'd like another glass.

00:08:17.740 --> 00:08:19.710
Don't you think
you're going a little fast?

00:08:19.710 --> 00:08:21.340
Don't worry!

00:08:21.340 --> 00:08:23.780
After all, this is really good stuff.

00:08:23.780 --> 00:08:25.340
Here.

00:08:26.580 --> 00:08:28.680
Yuu is a very good boy.

00:08:28.680 --> 00:08:29.880
Uh-huh.

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:33.020
I'm positive he'll turn out
to be just like my sister Emi.

00:08:33.020 --> 00:08:36.410
Yes, I'm certain. You agree
with me, don't you, Asuka?

00:08:36.930 --> 00:08:38.530
Well, yes...

00:08:38.530 --> 00:08:39.990
Right?

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:45.530
My Yuu is going to be
just like my big sister Emi.

00:08:45.530 --> 00:08:47.070
I just know it!

00:08:47.070 --> 00:08:48.260
I know...

00:08:48.260 --> 00:08:49.720
For sure!

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:53.760
Uh-oh...

00:08:54.810 --> 00:08:57.180
Gone, to the last drop.

00:08:58.580 --> 00:09:02.190
There's some photos on top
of the piano in the living room.

00:09:02.820 --> 00:09:03.940
Photos?

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:08.420
One of them is a photo of Mom
from when she was in middle school.

00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:11.150
It's a shot of her with my aunt.

00:09:12.290 --> 00:09:16.450
I asked her once about
why she had it out.

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:18.620
She said...

00:09:19.530 --> 00:09:22.340
My sister Emi was smart...

00:09:22.340 --> 00:09:24.630
good at sports and
anything else she did...

00:09:25.270 --> 00:09:27.880
She's cheerful, had lots of friends...

00:09:28.810 --> 00:09:31.810
So I'm sure you can become
just like her.

00:09:32.680 --> 00:09:34.680
It was kind of strange to me.

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:38.250
I'm sorry, Asuka.

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:42.390
That's okay. I'll pop out
for a second to buy wine.

00:09:42.690 --> 00:09:43.850
See you later.

00:09:46.260 --> 00:09:48.060
Why does Mom?

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:50.610
Why does she compare me to my aunt?

00:09:55.100 --> 00:09:59.400
Don't you think it's weird?
I've never even met my aunt.

00:10:00.480 --> 00:10:02.120
And besides...

00:10:02.640 --> 00:10:06.280
It started two years ago
after Grandma died.

00:10:06.280 --> 00:10:08.880
She started to talk about my aunt.

00:10:09.280 --> 00:10:10.750
Then let's try asking her about it!

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:11.950
Huh?

00:10:11.950 --> 00:10:15.920
Let's ask your mom why
she compares you to her sister.

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:17.680
No way, I don't wanna!

00:10:18.660 --> 00:10:19.530
Let's go!

00:10:19.530 --> 00:10:20.960
Hey!

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:22.000
No way!

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:23.660
Now! You have to ask her!

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:25.350
Quit it, Haruka!

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:26.900
I don't wanna!

00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:27.870
Just do it!

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:29.900
Stop it, Haruka!

00:10:36.640 --> 00:10:38.120
Emi...

00:10:42.780 --> 00:10:44.350
Oba-san?

00:10:46.150 --> 00:10:47.360
Yuu...

00:10:47.360 --> 00:10:49.960
Oba-san, there's something
we want to ask you.

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:53.060
Yuu, what are you doing?

00:10:53.060 --> 00:10:55.560
You have to come home with me at once!

00:10:56.060 --> 00:10:58.230
Mom, I...

00:10:58.230 --> 00:10:59.840
I'm not interested in excuses!

00:11:00.440 --> 00:11:02.170
Oba-san, please listen!

00:11:02.170 --> 00:11:05.410
Haruka-chan, this is
none of your concern.

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:08.400
Why do you compare Yuu to your sister?

00:11:10.410 --> 00:11:14.600
And you didn't tell him to do stuff
like that until two years ago, did you?

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:17.880
Two years ago?
What are you talking about?

00:11:19.590 --> 00:11:20.740
Two years ago...

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:25.500
Mom, it started right after
Grandma's funeral in Sapporo.

00:11:36.740 --> 00:11:39.720
Mom... I'm sorry.
I'll go in her place.

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:43.220
Stop it. Please, stop it!

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:45.680
Stop it!

00:12:02.230 --> 00:12:03.920
The dimension wavered.

00:12:09.570 --> 00:12:11.040
Mom just...

00:12:13.570 --> 00:12:15.610
Mom just disappeared!

00:12:31.490 --> 00:12:34.890
Yuu? Haruka-chan?
Where are you?

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:50.550
That chair...

00:12:50.550 --> 00:12:51.670
I'm home!

00:12:53.280 --> 00:12:54.520
Haruka-chan?

00:12:54.520 --> 00:12:57.080
Mom? Mom?

00:12:57.080 --> 00:13:00.660
What the? Maybe she's out.
Come on in, Miyuki.

00:13:00.660 --> 00:13:02.080
I...

00:13:02.790 --> 00:13:04.510
Want some juice, Miyuki?

00:13:06.360 --> 00:13:09.760
Asuka... I'm serious.

00:13:10.770 --> 00:13:14.650
You didn't believe me when I said
I wanted to run away from home.

00:13:15.340 --> 00:13:19.170
Oh, what are you talking about?
I asked you over because I believed in you.

00:13:19.170 --> 00:13:20.860
I'm serious, so...

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:25.070
It's easy to suggest running away,
but do you actually have a plan?

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:27.850
It'll be fine. I brought my savings.

00:13:27.850 --> 00:13:29.830
What? Really?!

00:13:30.790 --> 00:13:33.630
That's me and Asuka...

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:36.750
...from when we were in middle school.

00:13:37.990 --> 00:13:39.520
Where am I?

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:42.660
Karasu!

00:13:42.660 --> 00:13:45.070
Karasu, what'll I do? Oba-san...

00:13:45.070 --> 00:13:46.220
Yuu's mother...

00:13:46.730 --> 00:13:47.720
She disappeared!

00:13:48.500 --> 00:13:50.230
Disappeared?

00:13:50.670 --> 00:13:53.310
It's true. Mom vanished!

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:55.980
How come?
Do you know the reason?

00:13:57.080 --> 00:13:59.480
She must have had contact
with another dimension.

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:00.490
Huh?

00:14:00.850 --> 00:14:02.450
What do you mean?

00:14:03.080 --> 00:14:06.650
People's thoughts can sometimes
influence other dimensions.

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:10.750
People's thoughts?

00:14:13.460 --> 00:14:17.200
Occasionally, people's thoughts have
the power to interfere with the quanta...

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:21.270
that compose the entire
matter of the universe.

00:14:24.510 --> 00:14:25.890
The Dragon Torque.

00:14:27.340 --> 00:14:30.390
I loved my sister too.

00:14:33.480 --> 00:14:36.650
She was smart, cheerful, kind...

00:14:37.550 --> 00:14:40.190
I wish I had died in her place.

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:41.690
Miyuki...

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:45.120
I think that Mom would have
been happier that way, too.

00:14:45.430 --> 00:14:47.410
You can't start thinking that way!

00:14:48.600 --> 00:14:53.410
Since Mom loved her
way more than she loves me.

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:57.420
In those days, Mom...

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:04.300
Mom only paid attention to Emi
who had passed away.

00:15:04.950 --> 00:15:07.770
She always gave her far more
attention than she gave to me.

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:12.710
Where is she, Karasu?

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:15.140
In another dimension.

00:15:15.390 --> 00:15:18.100
A dimension of the thoughts
she can't erase.

00:15:18.530 --> 00:15:21.530
A dimension of thoughts?
Where is that?

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:25.230
The past. A dimension
located somewhere in the past.

00:15:25.800 --> 00:15:28.000
If this happened to her
because of my power...

00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:30.110
I can also use it
to bring her back, can't I?

00:15:31.170 --> 00:15:34.870
It is not an easy matter to get a fix
on the dimension she transported to.

00:15:35.980 --> 00:15:39.250
Searching through the
infinite number of dimensions...

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:42.380
would be like trying to find
a needle on a sandy beach.

00:15:42.980 --> 00:15:44.890
What should I do?

00:15:44.890 --> 00:15:46.810
You should be able to do it.

00:15:47.150 --> 00:15:49.180
You altered the flow of time
once before.

00:15:49.960 --> 00:15:50.970
Once before...

00:15:55.960 --> 00:15:59.130
But I don't remember much
about when that happened.

00:15:59.130 --> 00:16:00.700
I know you can do it.

00:16:01.970 --> 00:16:04.270
Believe in your own power.

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:09.030
What's the deal?

00:16:43.140 --> 00:16:45.610
I don't think I can do it.
It's not working.

00:16:45.610 --> 00:16:48.070
Believe it. You can do it.

00:16:48.720 --> 00:16:51.380
I have to track down
where her thoughts went.

00:16:52.020 --> 00:16:54.110
Karasu, I'm going to try it downstairs!

00:16:55.720 --> 00:16:59.080
I think I can get closer
to her thoughts that way.

00:17:00.130 --> 00:17:22.810
Haruka?

00:17:23.380 --> 00:17:25.350
Your mom's here.

00:17:26.820 --> 00:17:28.250
Hey...

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:33.320
Haruka, what's wrong?

00:17:34.900 --> 00:17:37.560
I just have to sense her.

00:17:39.670 --> 00:17:44.200
I'm sure your mom and dad
would worry if you ran away.

00:17:44.670 --> 00:17:46.340
No, they wouldn't.

00:17:46.910 --> 00:17:49.910
They would worry for sure!
Is that what you want?

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:53.070
Do you really think they would?

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:58.310
Yes... I wanted to be
just like my sister.

00:18:03.960 --> 00:18:07.030
I wanted to be loved like she was.

00:18:10.530 --> 00:18:13.220
I didn't want to run away from home.

00:18:14.840 --> 00:18:17.230
I just wanted to get
my mother's attention.

00:18:19.640 --> 00:18:21.830
But I never ran away.

00:18:22.480 --> 00:18:25.790
I just went up the mountain
on the ropeway and came home again.

00:18:26.110 --> 00:18:30.830
So Mom never had to worry about me.

00:18:34.290 --> 00:18:37.100
Yuu, would you give me some space?

00:18:37.100 --> 00:18:38.790
Uh, sure.

00:18:48.500 --> 00:18:50.070
I can hear it.

00:18:54.380 --> 00:18:55.820
I can hear you.

00:19:13.090 --> 00:19:14.520
Haruka?

00:19:19.230 --> 00:19:22.390
Please bring Yuu's mother
back to us.

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:33.200
What is that thing?

00:20:00.640 --> 00:20:01.930
I guess she found it.

00:20:06.480 --> 00:20:08.200
Is this?!

00:20:19.560 --> 00:20:21.250
She disappeared.

00:20:21.910 --> 00:20:23.260
Haruka?!

00:20:24.500 --> 00:20:25.660
Haruka?

00:20:28.070 --> 00:20:31.500
Miyuki!
My daughter Miyuki is missing!

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:36.340
And her travel bag is gone too!

00:20:36.340 --> 00:20:39.670
Don't worry.
Miyuki-chan is here with us.

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:42.750
By now I think she's
fast asleep with Asuka.

00:20:44.890 --> 00:20:47.250
That crazy girl... God...

00:20:47.250 --> 00:20:49.320
She worried me so much!

00:20:49.690 --> 00:20:52.380
Did you actually worry about me, Mom?

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:56.400
Her sister was taken from me
in a traffic accident last year.

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:59.030
If I lost her as well, I...

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:04.270
It's all right. So please
don't scold her too much.

00:21:04.270 --> 00:21:06.370
Yes, of course.

00:21:06.370 --> 00:21:08.340
Now I remember. That day...

00:21:09.340 --> 00:21:13.410
I will be waiting for her tomorrow
with her favorite meal, hamburger.

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:15.050
You're wrong, Mom.

00:21:15.850 --> 00:21:18.680
Emi was the one who liked hamburger.

00:21:19.890 --> 00:21:24.320
I loved everything you cooked.

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:31.830
Miyuki?

00:21:31.830 --> 00:21:33.660
Miyuki, are you asleep?

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:36.870
You'll catch a cold if you sleep there.

00:21:36.870 --> 00:21:39.240
Come on, get up. Miyuki?

00:21:39.240 --> 00:21:40.540
Mom?

00:21:40.540 --> 00:21:42.320
Oba-san!

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:45.200
Oba-san, give me your hand! Hurry!

00:21:53.520 --> 00:21:55.890
Oh, what are you doing, Yuu?

00:21:55.890 --> 00:21:57.590
Uh, I...

00:21:57.590 --> 00:21:59.760
Did you see your mom?

00:22:00.090 --> 00:22:01.880
No, I...

00:22:02.260 --> 00:22:04.800
Huh? Miyuki? Where did you go?

00:22:04.800 --> 00:22:06.170
Haruka.

00:22:06.170 --> 00:22:07.430
Welcome home.

00:22:07.430 --> 00:22:08.640
Where's Miyuki?

00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:10.390
I think she's asleep on the sofa.

00:22:11.670 --> 00:22:12.890
Miyuki...

00:22:12.890 --> 00:22:14.540
Mom!

00:22:15.540 --> 00:22:17.330
Mom, Mom!

00:22:20.650 --> 00:22:22.280
Yuu...

00:22:22.480 --> 00:22:23.920
Think they're okay?

00:22:23.920 --> 00:22:25.050
They'll be fine.

00:22:25.050 --> 00:22:25.750
Huh?

00:22:25.750 --> 00:22:27.280
After all, they're family.

00:22:29.720 --> 00:22:31.430
I must have drifted off.

00:22:31.430 --> 00:22:32.730
Are you okay?

00:22:32.730 --> 00:22:34.190
Yes...

00:22:35.460 --> 00:22:37.710
I'm going to stay here a while longer.

00:22:39.730 --> 00:22:43.300
I want to chat with
Haruka-chan's mother a little longer.

00:22:44.670 --> 00:22:46.610
She's my best friend.

00:22:46.610 --> 00:22:48.060
Mom...

00:22:59.590 --> 00:23:02.020
Traitors must die.

00:23:26.500 --> 00:23:30.380
A sleepless night

00:23:30.380 --> 00:23:34.270
The sound of the second hand

00:23:34.270 --> 00:23:41.200
The rumble of the
refrigerator in the air

00:23:42.100 --> 00:23:45.990
Just as the moon
through the blinds...

00:23:45.990 --> 00:23:49.900
Waxes and wanes, someday...

00:23:49.900 --> 00:23:56.490
The pain will change to warmth

00:23:56.490 --> 00:24:01.710
Boat of time...

00:24:02.300 --> 00:24:06.960
No matter where it flows...

00:24:06.960 --> 00:24:13.090
Most likely we'll meet again

00:24:13.090 --> 00:24:16.730
From scars come the
footsteps of dawn

00:24:16.730 --> 00:24:19.930
Rather than sighing,
they secretly...

00:24:19.930 --> 00:24:26.040
come pouring down
on every new day

00:24:26.040 --> 00:24:30.580
No matter what sky it is

00:24:42.520 --> 00:24:45.490
I'm dreaming again.

00:24:45.490 --> 00:24:47.540
That summer day's dream.

00:24:48.500 --> 00:24:51.390
Tell us what's happening 15 years from now!

00:24:53.730 --> 00:24:55.770
If you get in my way again...

00:24:56.600 --> 00:24:58.130
...l'll kill you!

00:25:02.040 --> 00:25:03.440
If it wasn't for you...

00:25:04.180 --> 00:25:06.870
Next episode, A Stormy Night.

00:25:07.780 --> 00:25:10.110
Will you tell me someday?
